record evidence-intake-project.assembly.enrichment-workspace/1 : work {
    title "Keyboard-driven enrichment workspace with a measured keystroke budget"
    state active
    scope [ path "src/gui/**", path "tests/**" ]
    intent """
        The throughput design: a grid-first WinSafe view with the original always rendered beside it; decide once per source in a profile and inherit everywhere; sweep one field across passages with single-key values, Enter to accept a candidate, x to reject it, '.' to repeat, Shift-letter and visual ranges to apply to a run, s to split a sub-span, g to group rows, p to set the reporting parent to the nearest preceding same-author passage, @ entity autocomplete with create-new and possibly-same-person, t for time entry with a sticky basis, n for boilerplate, u to supersede. Every keystroke that changes a value writes one interpretation row under the named actor. Workspace navigation moves to Ctrl-digit accelerators because the Alt namespace is full, and the accelerator-uniqueness test is extended. Just-in-time prompts use the same grammar when a passage is attached to a proposition. A scripted harness in tests/enrichment.rs drives the Workspace API and ratchets the budget: at most 1.6 keystrokes per material passage for form, speaker and stance; at most 4 per reported statement for parent and attributed person. Plan sections 5.1-5.7.
        """
    note """
        2026-08-24: the window is built and runs. Landed: the source picker with per-source counts, the profile screen writing a version that supersedes rather than overwrites, the grid with the sweep field's value, its provenance and a fixed badge, the full key grammar routed from LVN_KEYDOWN through Workspace::enrichment_key, entity autocomplete with create-new and possibly-same-person, time entry with a sticky basis, sub-span marking by verbatim text, the always-visible key sheet, F8 for the perception-basis sweep the grammar had no key for, Ctrl accelerators for all twelve views and Ctrl+E for the sweep, and the keystroke harness. Two pieces of this record's intent are not built and are carried by assembly.sweep-remaining-surfaces: the original is named and opened in the system viewer rather than rendered inside the window, and the just-in-time prompt from the packet workspace (plan 5.7) waits on the packet workspace itself.
        """
    depends_on [
        @evidence-intake-project.assembly.interpretation-schema,
        @evidence-intake-project.constraint.distinct-alt-keys,
        @evidence-intake-project.constraint.window-fits-the-screen
    ]
    part_of [ @evidence-intake-project.assembly.case-assembly ]
    source {
        kind external
        role origin
        document "collation-gap-review-2026-08-23"
        start_byte 23249
        end_byte 23858
        start_line 707
        end_line 722
        excerpt_hash "sha256:8359781dceea95dacdd4ad773d9388d7b0a2840e2b8ee9e7f020efa8af7ca5b2"
        use """
            The list of enrichment operations the UI must offer; the keystroke design and budget are the project's addition.
            """
    }
}

